# What stays local. Installed as .aep/.gitignore.
#
# Position is this working tree's operational state and must never be shared: a
# committed marker always describes somebody else's tree. Worktrees are isolated
# checkouts, which are infrastructure rather than knowledge. Scratch is a run's
# throwaway files (handoffs, notes, drafts), kept inside the project so nothing
# is written outside it, and never committed.
position/
scratch/
worktrees/
